# The Mill | INT | Dormitory | NIGHT | ei, kiku | Read the board | The rankings are posted. {kiku}: first. {ei}: third. Neither sleeps | | 4 | crowd=30, props=ranking board
# The Thread | INT | Reeling Hall | DAY | ei, marie, kiku | Find it | With her eyes shut, by feel, she draws one unbroken thread and does not look up for an hour. {kiku}, next basin, slows to her pace | {ei} becomes first-class | 5 | crowd=300, props=reeling basins
# The Thread | EXT | Mill Gate | DAY | ei, kiku, brunat | Hold the gate | Fever in the dormitory. Parents at the gate, shouting about blood. {brunat} pours his bottle onto the gravel. The two girls stand in the gateway in their work cords | | 5 | crowd=80
# The Choice | INT | Dormitory | NIGHT | ei, kiku | Read the letter | A marriage, money, an end to it. {kiku} asks what she will say. {ei} asks for ink | {ei} refuses the marriage | 5 | props=letter+inkstone
# The Choice | EXT | Mill Gate | DAWN | ei, kiku, marie | Part | Two postings, two provinces. A bow, measured, identical. {marie} bows too, badly, and is corrected by both | | 3
